{
  "_howto": [
    "HOW TO ADD A RIDER: replace a placeholder object in 'shoutouts' with:",
    "{\"handle\": \"@name\", \"url\": \"https://www.tiktok.com/@name\",",
    "\"avatar\": \"thumbs/so-name.webp\", \"blurb\": \"optional short descriptor\"}.",
    "Optional \"stats\" field: a second info line under the blurb, e.g.",
    "Optional \"handleImg\": an SVG/PNG wordmark rendered in place of the handle text (the handle stays as alt text).",
    "\"stats\": \"1.2K views · 300 likes · 50 followers\" (use the ' · ' separator).",
    "Put a small square avatar image in the repo at that path (webp preferred, ~160px).",
    "Placeholder slots use avatar shoutout-placeholder.svg and link to the Discord.",
    "Set \"enabled\": false to hide the whole section.",
    "Push to main; the site deploys automatically."
